# Inbox

Raw capture, unparsed input. Quick notes, voice transcriptions, links, ideas go here before being organized.

## Structure

One file per capture event. Frontmatter optional at inbox stage.

Example:
```
---
captured: 2026-08-18T14:30:00Z
source: voice
---

Fix the engine issue where...
```

Later, items are moved to `staging/` for processing and tagging.
